<title>MALAYSIA: Multi-Purpose completes bank stake buy.</title>
<headline>Multi-Purpose completes bank stake buy.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Multi-Purpose Holdings Bhd said on Monday it has completed the acquisition of the remaining 30 percent stake in Multi-Purpose Bank Bhd which it does not own.</p>
<p>In a statement, Multi-Purpose said the completion followed the approval by the Foreign Investment Committee for the acquisition.</p>
<p>Multi-Purpose bought the 30 percent stake in Multi-Purpose Bank, formerly known as Malaysian French Bank Bhd, from Banque Indosuez of France for 357.33 million ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
